%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe2d31c0a575d374f9b00d77d5d88faf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 3.End
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Dest
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a07dcf60f7ef3642920c2f88c59c818, type: 3}
    text: We made it, thank the Gods. I though that I would spend the rest of my
      time in there.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Zavren
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ea391b21d3571b74891285752549baee, type: 3}
    text: No way. You are a skilled fighter Dest. Surviving there would be a trivial
      thing for you.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Dest
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a07dcf60f7ef3642920c2f88c59c818, type: 3}
    text: I suppose, but the mental pressure it has on you... it can break a man
      much more than any physical trauma.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Sicur
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f842b72481fd6043bb45ee3ba848524, type: 3}
    text: The magic absorbing walls in those cells don't help the case either.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Zavren
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ea391b21d3571b74891285752549baee, type: 3}
    text: Agreed. I just hope Raindorf is ok.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Sicur
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f842b72481fd6043bb45ee3ba848524, type: 3}
    text: It is unfortunate that we were seperated. Still we have to gather our strenght
      if we think to get out of here alive. The escape has just begun.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Abdul
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8519536599c40ae47a63c37549b69ffe, type: 3}
    text: Don't worry, that was definetly the hardest part. Now, we need the clothes.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Dest
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a07dcf60f7ef3642920c2f88c59c818, type: 3}
    text: Here, I found it on our way out.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: You all get dressed.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Zavren
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ea391b21d3571b74891285752549baee, type: 3}
    text: So, how do we get Raindorf back?
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Abdul
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a4e25b23fb97a46489f95e4bf3dafbd2, type: 3}
    text: Well, I know a guy... He used to be a coworker. I could ask him for some
      help.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Sicur
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f842b72481fd6043bb45ee3ba848524, type: 3}
    text: Is he reliable? Can he be trusted?
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Abdul
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a4e25b23fb97a46489f95e4bf3dafbd2, type: 3}
    text: Of course... the trusted part. When it comes to being reliable... well,
      he gets by, i guess.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Dest
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bb680456bc018df4c966efbe0232b4d6, type: 3}
    text: Honestly, sounds like our best bet. I'm in.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Zavren
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ea391b21d3571b74891285752549baee, type: 3}
    text: I don't hear a better plan, so...
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Sicur
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f842b72481fd6043bb45ee3ba848524, type: 3}
    text: ... Alright.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -8729184345987915486, guid: a44f559a6e54c094daec21594f191ba7, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8304d5d84951d95428ef7af8e3bd4167, type: 3}
